msgid "Daiwa Winch"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-daiwa-winch.rst:11
#: b7b21f93c30f4e488c5f6e02de068b63
msgid "The `Daiwa winch <http://www.ele.okaya.co.jp/index_en.html>`__ is a high quality winch specially designed for drone delivery.  The winch includes a \"thread end detector switch\" that protects against pulling the line in too tightly and thus straining the device or breaking the thread.  The gripper includes a spring mechanism that automatically releases the package when it touches the ground."
msgstr ""

